 CaseCode NAME;B;CC;D;O;T
⍝ Demonstrate the case coding process used by ]GIT/]TOTXT/]FROMTXT
⍝ using any supplied char vec as a source (NAME).
⍝ No results.  Prints steps to console.

⍝ Requires: ⍙EZBase

 ⎕←'Supplied name: ',NAME,'; Characters: ',⍕⍴NAME
 B←⎕ENLIST ⍕¨NAME∊⎕AV[65+⍳26] ⋄ ⎕←'Binary: ',B
 B←⌽B                         ⋄ ⎕←'Binary Reversed: ',B
 D←2 10 ⍙EZBase B             ⋄ ⎕←'Decimal: ',D
 O←10 8 ⍙EZBase D             ⋄ ⎕←'Octal: ',O
 CC←'-',O                     ⋄ ⎕←'Result: ',NAME←NAME,CC
⍝ Now we decode the example to prove it has worked:
 ⎕←'Decode Case Coded Name...'
 O←(1+-(⌽NAME)⍳'-')↑NAME             ⋄ ⎕←'Octal: ',O
 D←8 10 ⍙EZBase O                    ⋄ ⎕←'Decimal: ',D
 T←¯1+NAME⍳'-'
 B←(-T)↑(T⍴'0'),10 2 ⍙EZBase D       ⋄ ⎕←'Binary Reversed: ',⍕B
 B←⌽B                                ⋄ ⎕←'Binary: ',⍕B
 B←B='1' ⍝ Convert to ⎕DR=11
⍝ Use the binary code to decode the casing of the name:
 NAME←⎕WCALL 'CharLower' (T↑NAME) ⋄ (B/NAME)←⎕WCALL 'CharUpper' (B/NAME)
 ⎕←'Result: ',NAME